    "defect/GJ19-B3-RANKING-IDENTIFIABILITY-01": {
      "disposition": "not_material",
      "reason": "Appendix B's learning proof uses question-response functions increasing in quality and a question distribution assigning positive mass to every question. Under that intended strict reading, their weighted expected score is strictly increasing. Exposing this consequence in Lemma B.3 adds no source condition; a constant-response diagnostic does not satisfy the source proof's reading."
    },
